{"c":[{"name":"20261005T102543Z-0a3850ef6a0fa08f","text":"H7: a18_vm_walk.py writes results.json after every check and in finally; VM jobs judge it with scripts/vm_results.py, not the transcript tail. test_a18_vm_walk.py runs the walk against stand-ins on any Mac.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261005T102543Z-4af89305464255b2","text":"H7: alternatives never withdraw for want of inline room: fitsInField picks inline or capsule; CaretLinePlacement puts capsules below the caret line, else above. Undrawn offers withdraw (notDrawn); offers drawn after publish use publish(shown: false) + reveal.","type":"note"}]}
